{"id":"bb7ab4318ec98937","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-first-order-r-resolution.md","title":"含因子化与标准化分离的R归结","display":"df-first-order-r-resolution — 含因子化与标准化分离的R归结","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-first-order-r-resolution","aliases":["72-df-first-order-r-resolution"],"display":"df-first-order-r-resolution — 含因子化与标准化分离的R归结","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-factoring]]","[[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I Definition in §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; source R-resolution with explicit domains","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-first-order-r-resolution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-first-order-r-resolution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-r-resolution — 含因子化与标准化分离的R归结"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e522095533d0175f\" href=\"?note=e522095533d0175f\" title=\"72-df-first-order-factoring\">72-df-first-order-factoring</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3ef46815f85bb26e\" href=\"?note=3ef46815f85bb26e\" title=\"72-lem-program-substitution-composition\">72-lem-program-substitution-composition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Definition in §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; source R-resolution with explicit domains"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\">\\(B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 遍历V上有限支持置换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,H\">\\(E,H\\)</span> 是有限非空正原子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span> 中变量隐式各自全称量化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RRes}(B,C,D):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\rho,\\theta,E,H,A\\ \\bigl[&amp;\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\land\\rho:V\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(B)\\cap\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(C\\rho)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varnothing\\ne E\\subseteq B\\cap\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varnothing\\ne H\\subseteq\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\land\\{\\overline L:L\\in H\\}\\subseteq C\\rho\\\\\n&amp;\\land A\\in E\\land\\operatorname{MGUAts}(E\\cup H,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land D=(B\\theta\\setminus\\{A\\theta\\})\\cup((C\\rho)\\theta\\setminus\\{\\overline{A\\theta}\\})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RRes}(B,C,D):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\rho,\\theta,E,H,A\\ \\bigl[&amp;\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\land\\rho:V\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(B)\\cap\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(C\\rho)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varnothing\\ne E\\subseteq B\\cap\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varnothing\\ne H\\subseteq\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\land\\{\\overline L:L\\in H\\}\\subseteq C\\rho\\\\\n&amp;\\land A\\in E\\land\\operatorname{MGUAts}(E\\cup H,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land D=(B\\theta\\setminus\\{A\\theta\\})\\cup((C\\rho)\\theta\\setminus\\{\\overline{A\\theta}\\})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先对第二父子句作有限变量置换，避开第一父子句的有限变量集。存在性用新鲜变量交换；该论证与程序子句的新鲜改名相同，也适用于有限文字集。θ同时统一两个选择集的去极性原子，因此所有选中正文字成为Aθ，负文字成为其互补。此式保留源书把因子化与二父归结合成一个R步的呈现；没有给含等号语言声称充分性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-factoring","status":"resolved","id":"e522095533d0175f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-factoring]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-program-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"3ef46815f85bb26e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"E,H","display":false},{"tex":"B,C","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RRes}(B,C,D):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\rho,\\theta,E,H,A\\ \\bigl[&\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\land\\rho:V\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}V\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(B)\\cap\\operatorname{vars}_{cl}(C\\rho)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\land\\varnothing\\ne E\\subseteq B\\cap\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\\\\n&\\land\\varnothing\\ne H\\subseteq\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\land\\{\\overline L:L\\in H\\}\\subseteq C\\rho\\\\\n&\\land A\\in E\\land\\operatorname{MGUAts}(E\\cup H,\\theta)\\\\\n&\\land D=(B\\theta\\setminus\\{A\\theta\\})\\cup((C\\rho)\\theta\\setminus\\{\\overline{A\\theta}\\})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2084,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"c489124090a894d6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-25","locat